ree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116324138860941312053627.jpeg/NpwShmms5JuGy6Cj1iBhGqrRn4Woqyyx8xsaufMbGrk\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116324140010180608485960.jpeg/jIbNYGqSc8Ji5KsGTmV908XXJKtPOsNYCRL8VAkS_FQ\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116324621403033600538629.jpeg/k6-0QkVbbOj57S5bFSZCtCP6NdTD3ltGS_rd7kv63e4\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116324635483836416179862.jpeg/k5ebDHafnBmSkm9kKv9TdVvROhgSD_BHHDBZuhwwWbo\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116324142468173824170483.jpeg/Oyr3MesIvAN6MGz_CZcbEJMQh7ozlKMz56_Tpuev06Y\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116324150169309184645392.jpeg/fsoUE_v3xWtJ7SWCD-QZ2W77IVMGVkHw7N3Vq-zd1as\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116324148671811584308614.jpeg/aY4Vkp1bIkBU_Jv5K24v6vXeGRpwIZHTAlz_LAJc_yw\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260402/1116324876072783872475923.jpeg/S8agxqrgBeEfJ2izDdlssrt_YHGyn6gzBcqEHAXKhBw\"/><figcaption>30歲泰國女星兼模特兒克莉絲汀（Christine Gulasatree Michalsky）（圖/翻攝自ig@gulasatree）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T01:38:15.337642+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2448,"images":24,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}